{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-139","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817220-line","text":"塞纳托斯的冥河将古战场浸泡，你站在阶梯边缘，俯瞰潮汐下摇曳的水草，一时难以分辨，它们是鲜活的新叶，还是草木的亡魂。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817221-line","text":"一位身材佝偻的老人涉水走到你的跟前，他歪着脑袋看向你，半晌才说出话来。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817222-line","text":"「朋友，能给我几块金币吗？只要让我登上塞纳托斯的渡船，我愿意付给你任何东西！」他抓住你的手臂，刺骨的深寒顿时让你汗毛直竖。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-3760681733198842516-choice","text":"多给两块，升个舱。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-8504485485723670482-choice","text":"意思意思得了。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-11758976937259342755-choice","text":"你向来尊老爱幼。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-14051534034883445655-choice","text":"甩开老人的亡魂。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-text-198504670273145965-effect","text":"地主家也没余粮了","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-139-talk-403817223-line","text":"说真的，在很长一段时间里，你都不想再和超自然事件打交道了。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
